{"unit_id": "tag:04R5:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论第<REF_0001>节的材料对概形（schemes）的芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的类似情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本节所研究的概形。"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "概形的芽。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形芽的态射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04NB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的一个性质。我们称<MATH_0002>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>在源与目标上平展局部（<ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target）的<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对芽（germs）的任意交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n当其平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）垂直箭头（vertical arrows）给定时，有<MATH_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "在源与目标上平展局部"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义中的概形。"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "所研究及图中的芽。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "芽之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "étale local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "在源与目标上平展局部", "context": "定义给出的局部性。"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "芽的交换图。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "垂直箭头的性质。"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头", "context": "定义图中同时变动源和目标的箭头。"}], "notes": []}
